  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate adaptation activities in Mukwidja-PCI-CCS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aim&#xa0;
&#xa0;
To enhance the food and nutrition security of 100 displaced vulnerable households in South Kivu, recognising the unique challenges faced by these households.&#xa0;
&#xa0;Project activities&#xa0;&#xa0;

To support victims in their settling in host communities&#xa0;
To provide climate adaption training to the entire community&#xa0;
To increase security for the entire community using climate smart agricultural practises focusing on land, crops, livestock,&#xa0;forestry&#xa0;and fisheries.&#xa0;&#xa0;
To provide mass awareness sessions on the theme of environmental protection to help prevent future catastrophes.&#xa0;

&#xa0;
This project will support Christian Aid Ireland&#x2019;s Chronic Crisis Stream programme, funded by Irish Aid.</narrative>
  </description>
